Allows you to select "I - Unidentified Items" in menus. Additionally if
option like_swimming is set, you can select "r - Items known to be
Rustprone". This helps quickly dropping items before taking a bath, but
won't help with some special items if they are not known (eg. gauntlets
of power). Does not affect saves/bones compatibility. Remember to
#define ITEMCAT in config.h.

